  "title": "Regression watch",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "summary": "A collection of nouns and verbs for watching for regressions: baselines kept as nouns, from page screenshots by hash to metrics with tolerances, API response shapes and video QA numbers; every change measured again under the same settings and compared by fixed rules; every mismatch measured twice more before anything is reported, so a flaky check is told apart from a real regression; regressions and flaky checks recorded as findings; and a new baseline accepted only by a person.",
