  "boundaries": [
    "Measurements are read-only: page loads and GET requests to a local build or a test target a person named, and local files.",
    "Only a person accepts a baseline; comparisons never move one, and every earlier set is kept.",
    "No worker switches or reverts a live version; that stays the release owner's act in the release and verify pack.",
    "Workers create nouns and propose verbs; an authorized requester enqueues the proposals worth doing.",
    "Importing the pack writes nothing and enqueues nothing."
